              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 543,
              "height": 217,
              "content": "Busrom is committed to crafting durable glass hardware using more eco-friendly materials and efficient manufacturing processes. By reducing energy consumption in production, minimizing waste, and enhancing product maintainability, we create lasting value for both our customers and the planet.",
